elowdotaccent Germandbls T Tbar Tcaron Tcedilla Tcommaaccent Tdotbelow Tlinebelow U Uacute Ubreve Ucircumflex Udblgrave Udieresis Udotbelow Ugrave Uhookabove Uhorn Uhornacute Uhorndotbelow Uhorngrave Uhornhookabove Uhorntilde Uhungarumlaut Uinvertedbreve Umacron Umacrondieresis Uogonek Uring Utilde Utildeacute V W W.ss03 Wacute Wacute.ss03 Wcircumflex Wcircumflex.ss03 Wdieresis Wdieresis.ss03 Wgrave Wgrave.ss03 X Y Yacute Ycircumflex Ydieresis Ydotaccent Ydotbelow Ygrave Yhookabove Ymacron Ytilde Z Zacute Zcaron Zdotaccent Zdotbelow];
@calt_FIG = [zero one two three four five six seven eight nine zero.ss04 zero.zero four.ss07 six.ss07 nine.ss07 zero.tf one.tf two.tf three.tf four.tf five.tf six.tf seven.tf eight.tf nine.tf four.tf.ss07 six.tf.ss07 nine.tf.ss07];
@calt_ZERO = [zero zero.ss04 zero.zero zero.tf];
